"""Paper-only stock options alert and evaluation script.

This file is intentionally restricted to paper trading. It watches a curated list
of option-capable Indian stocks, scans for intraday BUY/PUT signals, selects the
nearest CE/PE option contract, and logs the trade result to CSV without placing
any real Kite order.
"""
